# Hello-world artifact (demo-003)

## Background

Phase 5 acceptance mission: PO runs full handoff (evaluator → squad → memory), delivers a minimal artifact, QA verifies, then signals complete.

## Deliverables

- `artifacts/demo/hello.cmd` — prints `Guild House OK` when run from cmd
- `artifacts/demo/hello.sh` — same output for Git Bash (optional if one script suffices with shebang)

## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] `squad.md` exists with frontmatter `members` listing at least `evaluator` was consulted and implementer role chosen
- [ ] `memories/common/memory.md` lists scope and acceptance criteria
- [ ] Artifact runs: executing the script prints exactly `Guild House OK` (one line)
- [ ] QA chatroom status reports PASS for each criterion
- [ ] PO signals `mission_complete` only after QA pass

## Out of scope

- Guild House server code changes
- Network calls, databases, packaging

## Notes

- Trivial mission: evaluator should recommend **developer + qa**, skip senior-developer
- Guild master is absent by default; do not escalate unless acceptance is impossible
